  "name": "Chicken Pot Pie",
  "subtitle": "A savory chicken and vegetable pie with a creamy herb filling.",
  "description": "Combine cooked chicken, vegetables, creamy soup, milk, and herbs in a double pastry crust, then bake until golden and heated through.",
